      "title": "视频丨2026暑期档电影票房超92亿 “电影+”带动消费新活力",
      "url": "https://www.sxdaily.com.cn/2026-08/14/content_20080261.html",
      "source_name": "sxdaily.com.cn",
      "source_type": "media_report",
      "route_id": "serper-search",
